# The tests are development-only: they are run from a git checkout (CI and
# local development), not from the distributions. The wheel never contained
# them, since only src/ is packaged.
#
# Without this, setuptools' default sdist patterns pick up tests/test_moldrug.py
# on its own and ship a test module that cannot run, because the helpers it
# imports (get_vina, build_crem_test_db) and tests/data/ are left out.
prune tests
